    "detailed_description": "Galaxy Clicker is an idler desktop overlay that sits on the side of your screen. Gain Stardust by clicking, buy Stardust-generating celestial bodies, gain more Stardust, and repeat! Enjoy the satisfaction of incrementing numbers while getting other work done.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109310/extras/cf4a706d70fcee4a1636f78d11cd9c89.avif?t=1722541333\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><br><strong>Click to Harvest Stardust:</strong><br>Click on the originating planet to manually harvest Stardust. Gain a combo multiplier for clicking on critical harvest points.<br><br><strong>Buy Celestial Bodies:</strong><br>Stardust can be used to create celestial bodies that passively create more Stardust. Create stabilizing copies of Earth or black hole generators.<br><br><strong>Buy Upgrades:</strong><br>Upgrade your celestial bodies with your extra Stardust to increase Stardust-generating multipliers and increase the efficiency of your own manual Stardust harvesting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109310/extras/06e48b330b8b5ad1f4bd04c81ca65a7f.avif?t=1722541333\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><br><strong>Add Decorations:</strong><br>Place animated cosmetic celestial bodies around your screen after you unlock them to decorate your workspace.<br><br><strong>Multitask:</strong><br>Galaxy Clicker runs as an overlay to your desktop, letting you position it anywhere on your screen. Harvest Stardust during breaks or to release some nervous energy, then you can get back to work!",
    "about_the_game": "Galaxy Clicker is an idler desktop overlay that sits on the side of your screen. Gain Stardust by clicking, buy Stardust-generating celestial bodies, gain more Stardust, and repeat! Enjoy the satisfaction of incrementing numbers while getting other work done.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109310/extras/cf4a706d70fcee4a1636f78d11cd9c89.avif?t=1722541333\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><br><strong>Click to Harvest Stardust:</strong><br>Click on the originating planet to manually harvest Stardust. Gain a combo multiplier for clicking on critical harvest points.<br><br><strong>Buy Celestial Bodies:</strong><br>Stardust can be used to create celestial bodies that passively create more Stardust. Create stabilizing copies of Earth or black hole generators.<br><br><strong>Buy Upgrades:</strong><br>Upgrade your celestial bodies with your extra Stardust to increase Stardust-generating multipliers and increase the efficiency of your own manual Stardust harvesting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109310/extras/06e48b330b8b5ad1f4bd04c81ca65a7f.avif?t=1722541333\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><br><strong>Add Decorations:</strong><br>Place animated cosmetic celestial bodies around your screen after you unlock them to decorate your workspace.<br><br><strong>Multitask:</strong><br>Galaxy Clicker runs as an overlay to your desktop, letting you position it anywhere on your screen. Harvest Stardust during breaks or to release some nervous energy, then you can get back to work!",
    "short_description": "An idle clicker game that sits on the side of your screen. Watch the numbers go up while getting other important things done.",
